    "What is your relationship with mathematics?": "Mathematics holds a practical yet analytical role for me. As someone self-employed, I find it useful in budgeting, problem-solving business challenges, and even crafting recipes (like my baking!). However, beyond utility, I enjoy its structured logic—it’s like solving puzzles. It feels empowering when I grasp concepts well but can be mentally taxing if stuck on abstract ideas, much like the chemistry I dislike.",
